WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.310
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.310
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.320 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.320 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.240 --> 01:50.580
THE FINAL AVAN STYLE TECHNIQUE

01:59.380 --> 02:00.930
Zaboera!

02:04.770 --> 02:07.160
Wait a minute! I'm not...!

02:07.160 --> 02:08.770
Take this!

02:11.020 --> 02:13.320
I'm not him!

02:14.570 --> 02:16.490
A Morph spell?!

02:18.900 --> 02:22.180
It's too bad that
that wasn't the real me.

02:22.180 --> 02:27.620
I'll eventually show you dimwits
that I'm on a different level up here.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.750
Sneaky little imp.

02:33.880 --> 02:36.000
Mystvearn's gone, too.

02:38.920 --> 02:40.720
What did I...

02:41.300 --> 02:42.780
<i>Where's Hadlar?</i>

02:42.780 --> 02:45.810
<i>I remember killing him...</i>

02:48.810 --> 02:51.600
Valge tower. We're finally here.

02:51.980 --> 02:55.630
We have to hurry
or Leona won't make it! Let's charge in!

02:55.630 --> 02:57.540
I knew you'd say that.

02:57.540 --> 02:58.400
Let's go!

02:58.610 --> 02:59.780
Halt!

03:02.780 --> 03:04.030
The Blizzblaze Legion!

03:04.320 --> 03:07.260
We won't let you get to Master Flazzard!

03:07.260 --> 03:08.950
Get them!

03:12.210 --> 03:13.040
Woosh!

03:17.130 --> 03:17.810
Dai?!

03:17.810 --> 03:20.420
We don't have time to hang around here!

03:21.180 --> 03:22.510
-Popp!
-Right!

03:23.260 --> 03:25.050
Kafrizz!

03:29.220 --> 03:30.580
The Frostburn!

03:30.580 --> 03:32.700
Okay! Now for the Dancing Flames!

03:32.700 --> 03:33.570
Maam!

03:33.570 --> 03:34.330
Got it!

03:34.330 --> 03:36.480
Here goes! Crackle!

03:48.240 --> 03:49.580
We did it!

03:50.660 --> 03:53.540
Anything's possible
if we work together, huh?

03:55.170 --> 03:56.770
Okay! Let's go!

03:56.770 --> 03:57.750
Right!

04:07.720 --> 04:08.820
Flazzard!

04:08.820 --> 04:14.040
Sitting back and waiting
with the hostage just isn't my style.

04:14.040 --> 04:15.060
Here you go!

04:15.480 --> 04:18.190
That's one down!

04:25.280 --> 04:27.070
That axe...!

04:27.410 --> 04:29.200
Your savagery ends here!

04:30.240 --> 04:31.970
Crocodine!

04:31.970 --> 04:34.830
So you were helping them!

04:35.040 --> 04:36.540
It wasn't just me.

04:39.090 --> 04:40.230
Hyunckel!

04:40.230 --> 04:45.350
See? I told you.
You can't kill a guy like him.

04:45.350 --> 04:49.100
Wait. Does that mean he beat Hadlar?!

04:49.720 --> 04:51.120
Bastard.

04:51.120 --> 04:55.810
I remembered I owed you
much like I did Hadlar.

04:56.480 --> 04:59.310
So I came back from the depths of hell.

05:00.610 --> 05:02.570
There's no escape now.

05:08.030 --> 05:10.720
What's wrong?! You giving up?!

05:10.720 --> 05:12.180
I guess so.

05:12.180 --> 05:12.910
Huh?!

05:13.830 --> 05:16.210
My Blizzblaze Curse Field's gone.

05:16.500 --> 05:22.310
And with two Legion Commanders
on your side, even I can't win.

05:22.310 --> 05:25.610
I guess it's time to face the fact.

05:25.610 --> 05:28.010
He's acting awfully well-behaved.

05:28.760 --> 05:32.220
<i>Flazzard's not one
to say something like that.</i>

05:32.680 --> 05:37.190
So you'll admit defeat and release
the Princess of Papnica?

05:37.850 --> 05:39.810
Don't be stupid.

05:40.730 --> 05:46.190
Even if I lose everything,
I'll never give up a chance at victory!

05:47.490 --> 05:49.550
Then what was that about facing the fact?!

05:49.550 --> 05:52.930
I meant the fact that
I won't get through this unscathed.

05:52.930 --> 05:58.790
The final attack I'm about to use
hurts me real bad.

05:59.540 --> 06:02.790
I'd prefer not to use it, but...

06:04.800 --> 06:09.090
Dark King Vearn, grant me glory and victory.

06:14.220 --> 06:15.100
What?!

06:15.430 --> 06:18.610
You're throwing away your medal?!

06:18.610 --> 06:20.940
What's so important about that?

06:22.810 --> 06:26.070
The day Sovereign Rock Castle
was completed...

06:29.360 --> 06:30.700
<i>That's right.</i>

06:30.990 --> 06:36.620
<i>It was the first time we
Six Legion Commanders had gathered.</i>

06:37.580 --> 06:40.390
Oh great Dark King Vearn,

06:40.390 --> 06:46.020
the Six Legion Commanders to lead
the Dark Army are before you now.

06:46.020 --> 06:50.570
This Sovereign Rock Castle shall be our
base as we plunge the world into darkness,

06:50.570 --> 06:54.030
and offer it to you, King Vearn.

06:54.030 --> 06:58.770
Well done, Hadlar. I am most pleased.

06:59.140 --> 07:00.140
My king.

07:00.600 --> 07:06.980
To celebrate the Six Legion Commanders,
I shall grant a gift.

07:07.150 --> 07:08.280
A gift?

07:11.070 --> 07:12.840
W-What the...?!

07:12.840 --> 07:14.070
Huh?

07:14.830 --> 07:16.450
What's that?

07:16.790 --> 07:23.290
That is the Infernal Emblem. Consider it
the greatest symbol of loyalty to me.

07:23.670 --> 07:28.150
Now, whoever believes
themself worthy may take it.

07:28.150 --> 07:30.530
What intense flames!

07:30.530 --> 07:34.970
But we must prove our loyalty
to King Vearn!

07:53.820 --> 07:57.370
Well done, Flazzard.

07:59.580 --> 08:05.540
That's when he gained the title
"Blitz Captain of the Dark Army."

08:06.130 --> 08:10.130
That medal is a symbol of his glory.

08:10.130 --> 08:12.820
To him, it's almost worth life itself.

08:12.820 --> 08:15.340
And he threw it away?!

08:16.180 --> 08:21.140
Who needs past glory?!
If it will let me claim new victory...

08:21.430 --> 08:22.810
I'm willing...

08:24.560 --> 08:25.400
Look out!

08:25.650 --> 08:29.940
...to risk my life!

08:36.530 --> 08:37.700
What?!

08:38.030 --> 08:39.390
He self-destructed?!

08:39.390 --> 08:42.180
Self-destructed? With this weak a blast?

08:42.180 --> 08:47.040
Even in death he seeks glory. How pitiful.

08:48.790 --> 08:49.630
Ow.

08:49.960 --> 08:50.710
Ow!

08:51.170 --> 08:53.010
Ow, ow, ow!

08:55.800 --> 08:58.970
This is... a fragment of Flazzard's body!

08:58.970 --> 09:00.220
What?!

09:04.810 --> 09:06.100
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

09:06.310 --> 09:07.150
Could it be...?!

09:07.480 --> 09:10.610
Yeah! It really can be!

09:11.110 --> 09:16.610
Each one of these rocks is me!

09:18.370 --> 09:22.300
These are bullets of rock!
They're Rock Bullets!

09:22.300 --> 09:23.500
Curse you!

09:31.590 --> 09:32.710
Crocodine!

09:33.800 --> 09:36.380
What do you think you're doing?!

09:37.050 --> 09:40.890
It doesn't matter how strong you are!

09:41.300 --> 09:45.020
The more you break,
the more of me there is!

09:46.230 --> 09:51.440
This is my final attack method,
Rock Bullet Shrapnel Detonation!

09:51.610 --> 09:53.790
Then I'll just freeze them all!

09:53.790 --> 09:54.860
Crackle!

10:01.870 --> 10:03.490
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

10:04.580 --> 10:08.210
Whoops. He has ice rocks.

10:08.870 --> 10:09.920
Popp!

10:10.540 --> 10:11.440
Don't, Dai!

10:11.440 --> 10:14.590
Looks like you're up, big Hero!

10:15.550 --> 10:16.920
Earth Slash!

10:27.350 --> 10:28.940
Die!

10:30.900 --> 10:32.060
Dai!

10:38.030 --> 10:40.570
MAGIC BULLET GUN

10:43.030 --> 10:45.580
FIVE FINGER FLARES

10:46.580 --> 10:47.450
Dai!

10:50.540 --> 10:51.540
Hyunckel!

10:56.000 --> 10:57.590
Bastard!

10:59.010 --> 11:01.490
Dai, aim for his core!

11:01.490 --> 11:02.310
His core?

11:02.310 --> 11:07.390
That's right. He said all of these rocks
are him, but that's not true.

11:07.930 --> 11:12.560
<i>He's an energy rock life-form created by
Hadlar using Forbidden Magic.</i>

11:13.100 --> 11:16.900
<i>There should only be one core rock
that's the source of his life.</i>

11:17.280 --> 11:19.530
<i>You have to find it and break it!</i>

11:20.070 --> 11:21.400
His core...

11:22.070 --> 11:26.680
But how can I find a single rock
among all of these?

11:26.680 --> 11:30.460
Unless you do, Flazzard can't be beaten!

11:31.160 --> 11:32.670
What are you talking about?!

11:34.750 --> 11:38.090
Nothing can defeat my ultimate attack!

11:38.590 --> 11:39.670
Darn it!

11:41.680 --> 11:44.590
It's not good! I can't find it!

11:49.140 --> 11:55.020
No human can shatter my core hidden here!

11:55.400 --> 11:56.710
<i>I can't beat him!</i>

11:56.710 --> 12:00.440
<i>How can I cut an enemy I can't see?!</i>

12:00.690 --> 12:03.760
Once you can cut the unseen,

12:03.760 --> 12:07.530
your blade will become
three, or even five times more powerful.

12:08.620 --> 12:10.200
<i>An enemy I can't see!</i>

12:10.620 --> 12:12.620
<i>That's why he had me train!</i>

12:13.500 --> 12:17.250
<i>The air... in other words,
you slice the emptiness.</i>

12:23.680 --> 12:24.970
Dai...

12:25.430 --> 12:26.430
A Heal spell...

12:28.930 --> 12:33.230
Looks like hiding behind Crocodine
spared you some damage.

12:38.900 --> 12:40.230
Flazzard?!

12:44.110 --> 12:46.670
<i>His flames and cold are dwindling!</i>

12:46.670 --> 12:50.090
I look pathetic to you, don't I?

12:50.090 --> 12:54.830
This final attack method
drains my life drastically.

12:55.540 --> 12:58.590
Why do you risk death just to win?!

12:59.500 --> 13:02.090
My being has no history.

13:03.340 --> 13:08.150
It's been barely a year
since Master Hadlar created me.

13:08.150 --> 13:11.740
That's why I want achievements!

13:11.740 --> 13:18.160
Achievements no one can beat whether
they live to be a hundred or a thousand!

13:18.160 --> 13:20.400
You're so pitiful.

13:21.110 --> 13:25.130
Can't you prove yourself
through something other than fighting?

13:25.130 --> 13:27.660
Who asked for your pity?!

13:28.700 --> 13:33.680
The thrill of victory!
The jealous glares of my peers!

13:33.680 --> 13:36.020
They are what fulfill me!

13:36.020 --> 13:41.560
If you all would just die,
then everything will be perfect!

13:41.560 --> 13:42.710
Wait!

13:46.220 --> 13:47.180
Dai!

13:48.300 --> 13:52.180
Don't you see that you can't win?

13:52.600 --> 13:56.580
I'm going to use my final attack now.

13:56.580 --> 14:01.110
It's the greatest technique of
my master, Avan.

14:01.860 --> 14:04.690
I've never successfully done it before.

14:06.190 --> 14:08.610
If I fail, you win.

14:10.030 --> 14:11.240
But...

14:12.030 --> 14:15.620
if I can do it... I win!

14:17.080 --> 14:19.210
You're just bluffing!

14:19.710 --> 14:20.750
Dai!

14:20.750 --> 14:22.090
That attack...!

14:34.970 --> 14:36.980
Here goes, kid!

14:37.730 --> 14:40.900
Blizzblaze Shrapnel Detonation!

14:49.610 --> 14:50.910
He didn't dodge?!

14:52.070 --> 14:54.330
Avan Style Sword Technique...

14:55.910 --> 14:57.120
Air Slash!

15:05.170 --> 15:06.300
Did it work?!

15:18.020 --> 15:23.690
If that pathetic attack is his greatest
technique, I guess Avan's not much, huh?

15:24.150 --> 15:26.940
<i>No... I failed.</i>

15:27.400 --> 15:28.400
<i>Is it...</i>

15:29.360 --> 15:33.780
<i>Is it really beyond me, Master?</i>

15:37.490 --> 15:39.700
What is it, Dai?

15:40.080 --> 15:44.190
That last one, the Air Slash,
I don't get it.

15:44.190 --> 15:47.770
Oh come on.
Master's explained it a ton of times.

15:47.770 --> 15:49.610
Then did you understand it?

15:49.610 --> 15:53.720
I'm a Mage, so I don't have to.

15:54.390 --> 15:59.330
That sort of thinking is why
your progress is so slow.

15:59.330 --> 16:02.230
What would you do
against an evil swordsman?

16:03.850 --> 16:07.270
Then again, an evil swordsman
wouldn't use this skill.

16:07.440 --> 16:09.340
Huh? Why not?

16:09.340 --> 16:12.990
Air Slash requires an Aura of Justice.

16:13.490 --> 16:15.200
An Aura of Justice?

16:15.740 --> 16:20.670
<i>There are monsters in this world
created by dark magic.</i>

16:20.670 --> 16:25.670
<i>Air Slash is an attack
that vanquishes such evil beings.</i>

16:26.330 --> 16:28.290
To do it, first...

16:28.880 --> 16:31.840
you charge your blade
with the Aura of Justice.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.550
And then...

16:36.840 --> 16:41.140
you have to release it towards
the enemy's true form.

16:41.930 --> 16:46.440
The difficult part is determining
where the enemy's true form is.

16:46.850 --> 16:53.300
Unlike the weak spots of normal monsters,
you can't see it with your eyes.

16:53.300 --> 16:55.130
Did you get that?

16:55.130 --> 16:56.950
Kind of?

16:57.280 --> 17:03.510
Don't worry about it.
I'm sure you'll pick it up eventually.

17:03.510 --> 17:06.790
How to see an unseen enemy.

17:10.500 --> 17:12.260
<i>It's no good, Master!</i>

17:13.630 --> 17:16.820
<i>I can't... see it!</i>

17:16.820 --> 17:19.510
I'll burn you to a crisp!

17:21.180 --> 17:22.580
Dai, run!

17:22.580 --> 17:28.190
This is the end!

17:32.610 --> 17:34.440
What the hell?!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.930
His Air Slash wasn't a complete failure!

17:38.930 --> 17:44.310
No way! You're telling me
that attack grazed my core?!

17:44.310 --> 17:48.770
Okay! I'll do it until I succeed!

17:48.770 --> 17:50.600
In that case, one more time!

17:50.600 --> 17:54.980
Don't! If you use
that attack again, it'll kill you!

17:54.980 --> 17:57.470
You'll all die first!

17:57.800 --> 18:03.600
Besides, the risk of getting burned
is what makes gambling fun!

18:05.310 --> 18:08.690
He's blinded by the glory of victory!

18:09.060 --> 18:13.980
Here goes, Dai!
It's a showdown between our final attacks!

18:14.940 --> 18:16.940
Rock Bullet Shrapnel Detonation!

18:19.820 --> 18:20.700
Air Slash!

18:40.760 --> 18:42.300
It's not working!

18:42.470 --> 18:47.290
Looks like with this many targets,
there's no hope for any accidental hits!

18:47.290 --> 18:51.150
Looks like I win this fight!

18:53.900 --> 18:55.000
Dai!

18:55.000 --> 18:56.440
Dammit!

18:59.450 --> 19:03.680
Is it no good?!
Isn't there anything Dai can do?

19:03.680 --> 19:04.740
There is!

19:05.410 --> 19:06.450
Hyunckel!

19:06.870 --> 19:11.810
Dai's forgetting that Air Slash
is an attack that slices the empty!

19:11.810 --> 19:17.130
Unlike the earth and the sea, you can't
see the empty no matter how hard you try!

19:17.880 --> 19:19.090
I'm going to...

19:20.090 --> 19:22.030
remind him of that!

19:22.030 --> 19:24.030
Dai! Over here!

19:24.030 --> 19:25.050
Huh?!

19:25.810 --> 19:27.430
W-What are you doing?!

19:27.640 --> 19:29.950
Dai! Look with your inner eye!

19:29.950 --> 19:31.200
My inner eye?!

19:31.200 --> 19:35.290
As an attack, your Air Slash
is already complete!

19:35.290 --> 19:37.630
But it's not yet a mastered technique!

19:37.630 --> 19:40.530
Once you see your enemy
with your inner eye,

19:41.070 --> 19:42.580
it will be a true technique!

19:42.580 --> 19:44.370
It'll become a true Air Slash!

19:44.990 --> 19:47.550
Find him with... my inner eye!

19:47.550 --> 19:53.430
Air Slash strikes dark energy
with light energy to destroy evil!

19:53.430 --> 19:56.770
That's why I could never master it!

19:56.770 --> 20:02.380
Now is the time for you to inherit
the greatest Avan Style technique!

20:02.550 --> 20:03.610
You morons!

20:03.610 --> 20:10.310
As if such a fantasy attack
could defeat my ultimate attack!

20:11.390 --> 20:12.250
Dai!

20:12.250 --> 20:14.000
Look out! Run!

20:14.000 --> 20:16.440
Dai!

20:17.980 --> 20:19.230
<i>That's right.</i>

20:20.070 --> 20:23.910
<i>I can't find it
because I keep looking for it.</i>

20:24.950 --> 20:26.120
<i>Sense it!</i>

20:27.200 --> 20:30.540
<i>The life energy of everyone here!</i>

20:34.040 --> 20:38.480
<i>I feel a warm presence.
That must be Maam.</i>

20:38.480 --> 20:40.590
<i>There's Hyunckel.</i>

20:41.210 --> 20:43.590
<i>The big one is Crocodine.</i>

20:44.010 --> 20:46.050
<i>There's Popp over there.</i>

20:47.050 --> 20:48.260
<i>Something's coming!</i>

20:49.100 --> 20:51.180
<i>A giant evil energy!</i>

20:51.470 --> 20:55.940
<i>It's approaching me,
giving off malice everywhere!</i>

20:57.190 --> 20:58.440
<i>I can see it!</i>

20:58.770 --> 20:59.650
<i>This is...</i>

21:01.070 --> 21:02.320
<i>his core!</i>

21:04.320 --> 21:05.530
<i>This is...</i>

21:05.780 --> 21:07.200
<i>This is...</i>

21:08.240 --> 21:10.030
<i>Flazzard!</i>

21:15.120 --> 21:17.250
Air Slash!

21:35.850 --> 21:38.770
Looks like another dud...

21:42.820 --> 21:45.570
That's my... My core!

21:46.490 --> 21:47.910
It's done.

21:48.320 --> 21:49.410
I've hit...

21:50.030 --> 21:51.200
my target!

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.200
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.200
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.710
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.710
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.300 --> 22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.300 --> 22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.680 --> 23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.680 --> 23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.190
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.190
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.220 --> 23:37.430
<i>Dai's Air Slash struck Flazzard.</i>

23:37.600 --> 23:44.310
<i>Just when victory is at hand, Mystvearn,
the Shadow Vizier appears before Dai.</i>

23:44.480 --> 23:50.610
<i>After turning into Dark Aura,
a spiteful Flazzard attacks Dai again.</i>

23:50.780 --> 23:53.860
<i>Dai and Flazzard's final showdown begins.</i>

23:54.320 --> 23:56.580
<i>DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai,</i>

23:56.740 --> 23:58.580
<i>"Now I Slice Everything"</i>

23:58.740 --> 24:00.700
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

24:00.700 --> 24:02.710


